": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162731_874801452683124_8480571075237773312_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w90BLJ_smzMQ7kNvwFHX-Yg&_nc_oc=AdqbBv9VF0YWp82XIiKpYgxaDvbNTZbGY5tCEWPH1EDm12tcwcwd8smlsHtuVRqXWtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVECcBVJZXEHyJKuMc3UkprSXg5T9oBl7p041Ff9_96w&oe=6AFDC31E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "617753082397689", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_380404315735500_5291713739500814336_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=grD05FeWmJUQ7kNvwEKilaf&_nc_oc=AdpSLqtP7g8btU9b_fwJKvB8sOLFihwZO1Ns5aG8luYoR_d7E_OirYo4zYb8Sr7mQ7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQP-7OSE1QwEGCNAap8Io8ryu6M3P9nPhDRRudSnOR_5g&oe=6AFDCE31"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "231528434908924", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162731_732867726913630_7537884319939821568_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Kp7hCyuuI0Q7kNvwEC3f1x&_nc_oc=Adrhytaal-8VGX2hrtIFn4siESKLArfxUiAY97DMqg6hyePfxxaVbAfCM9HU49aSfuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSoVGHpvY_a9QNzcJvGtCaMr0nKm1TDsug1q3txPyUCgQ&oe=6AFDB5A0"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "212399816653872", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_1756596874645581_2822882841732317184_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BWedPVYDsrgQ7kNvwE0gbQc&_nc_oc=AdqsanK8tWUWMqkJtgm-7beoXpL7CpS8CsuGYifsWglLwWWFIha56Q3mhXGvvXi1whA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTPx8pFfSxeWwuGmb6cgtDO1Nxj-5nhZxrdHoglOKGl-g&oe=6AFDD9A0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "11162731_874801452683124_8480571075237773312_n.png", "id": "1673110742720080", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162694_1673110746053413_890324910616870912_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0vXD4pH8NHkQ7kNvwH9tFJV&_nc_oc=AdqzaifLzliStQ4ao1oqVLxh4Ewa-zGyXfieaxIWsr64HdjfpvV9qkiFDBkqvPifNz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIIt_phvPu5oDXMKVluYQsNHqDygdzfmxiCA--JwA4MA&oe=6AFDDFCD"}, "display_name": "Virry Safari 2: Feel the Wild", "keywords": ["animals", "video", "kids", "lion", "best"], "long_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!\n\n\u201cI have seen thousands of spherical videos, and the footage from Virry VR is the most stunning nature scenes I have ever seen in any medium. Seeing a big rhino, in its natural home, from the perspective of a mud puddle inches away, or having a lion literally lick my face to test if I am edible, were among the coolest things I have done in VR to date.\u201d\nJeremy Bailenson, Founding Director of The Virtual Human Interaction Lab, Stanford University.", "short_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develo